{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [6.731817] ✅️ /-- Canonical distribution of the original finite-support product family. -/\n    private def prodFamilyEquiv {R : Type r} [CommRing R] {ι : Type i} (A : ι → Type a) (B : ι → Type b)\n        [∀ i, AddCommGroup (A i)] [∀ i, Module R (A i)] [∀ i, AddCommGroup (B i)] [∀ i, Module R (B i)] :\n        (⨁ i, A i × B i) ≃ₗ[R] (⨁ i, A i) × (⨁ i, B i) :=\n      by\n      let f := DirectSum.lmap (fun i => LinearMap.fst R (A i) (B i))\n      let g := DirectSum.lmap (fun i => LinearMap.snd R (A i) (B i))\n      let l := DirectSum.lmap (fun i => LinearMap.inl R (A i) (B i))\n      let r := DirectSum.lmap (fun i => LinearMap.inr R (A i) (B i))\n      exact\n        { toFun := fun z => (f z, g z)\n          invFun := fun z => l z.1 + r z.2\n          left_inv := by\n            intro z\n            apply DFinsupp.ext\n            intro i\n            simp [f, g, l, r, DirectSum.lmap_apply]\n          right_inv := by\n            rintro ⟨z, w⟩\n            apply Prod.ext <;> apply DFinsupp.ext <;> intro i <;> simp [f, g, l, r, DirectSum.lmap_apply]\n          map_add' := fun z w => Prod.ext (f.map_add z w) (g.map_add z w)\n          map_smul' := fun c z => Prod.ext (f.map_smul c z) (g.map_smul c z) }\n  [Elab.definition.header] [1.041265] ✅️ _private.Aglib.AlgebraicGeometry.Cohomology.StructureSheaf.KunnethOpenMayerVietoris.0.DirectSum.prodFamilyEquiv\n    [Elab.step] [0.105510] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.15, term\n        ∀ i, Module R (A i)\n      [Elab.step] [0.105284] ✅️ expected type: Type (max a r), term\n          Module R (A i)\n        [Elab.app.args] [0.104975] ✅️ elabAppArgs (2 args) `Module`\n          [Elab.app.finalize] [0.101795] ✅️ Module R (A i) : Type (max r a)\n    [Elab.step] [0.105224] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.24, term\n        ∀ i, Module R (B i)\n      [Elab.step] [0.104895] ✅️ expected type: Type (max b r), term\n          Module R (B i)\n        [Elab.app.args] [0.104602] ✅️ elabAppArgs (2 args) `Module`\n