{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [0.323886] ✅️ private theorem biprodIsoProd_desc_sub_hom_value {R : Type r} [CommRing R]\n        (A B C : ModuleCat.{u} R) (f : A ⟶ C) (g : B ⟶ C) (y : (A ⊞ B : ModuleCat.{u} R)) :\n        biprod.desc f (-g) y = f ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).1 - g ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).2 :=\n      by\n      have h :=\n        biprodIsoProd_desc_sub_inv_value A B C f g ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).1\n          ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).2\n      simp only [Prod.mk.eta] at h\n      have hCancel := ModuleCat.inv_hom_apply (ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B) y\n      have hMap := congrArg (fun z => biprod.desc f (-g) z) hCancel\n      exact hMap.symm.trans h\n  [Elab.definition.header] [0.322286] ✅️ _private.Aglib.AlgebraicGeometry.Cohomology.StructureSheaf.KunnethOpenMayerVietoris.0.ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd_desc_sub_hom_value\n    [Elab.step] [0.246656] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.23, term\n        biprod.desc f (-g) y = f ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).1 - g ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).2\n      [Elab.step] [0.246359] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.23, term\n          binrel% Eq✝ (biprod.desc f (-g) y)\n            (f ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).1 - g ((ModuleCat.biprodIsoProd A B).hom y).2)","endPos":{"column":25,"line":149},"fileName":"/root/autodl-tmp/lean-build/logs/remote-0bf25ffb690f4617b1700cd0d5e17126/probe-0/Aglib/AlgebraicGeometry/Cohomology/StructureSheaf/KunnethOpenMayerVietoris.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"trace","pos":{"column":0,"line":139},"severity":"information"}
